			"words": [["ACF(k)", "Correlation between week t and week t − k, using the whole-series mean."], ["PACF(k)", "Correlation with week t − k after removing the effect of the weeks in between."]],
			"problem": "Series 50, 50, 51, 52, 54, 53, 56, 58 (mean 53). ACF results: lag 1 = 0.53; lag 2 = 0.17; lag 3 = 0.03. Compute PACF lag 2 by (r₂ − r₁²) ÷ (1 − r₁²) and read it.",
