			"say": "One page, one decision: spend, rate, cost per form. A dual axis must name both units, otherwise viewers think two bars share a scale.",
			"check": ["Why should spend (6, 5, 4) and rate (4, 4, 2) not share an axis?", "They have different units (million and %); numbers close together on a shared axis would suggest they are comparable."]
